      "strict tally and measured sharing",
      "ritual substitution over doctrinal purity",
      "route secrecy over fixed residence",
      "heat before sanctity"
    ],
    "taboos": [
      "do not name the dead after dusk",
      "do not sleep above an uncounted body",
      "do not waste lamp oil on private grief",
      "do not mark a child for weighing twice",
      "do not ring a bridge bell without witness"
    ],
    "hopes": [
      "eastward ascent to the lit terraces",
      "reopening the sealed cistern route",
      "a new count free of the old toll law",
      "carrying the children above the corpsefire smoke",
      "finding an unwatched bridge out"
